    "body": "## Motivation\n\nAnthropic clients send `tool_choice.disable_parallel_tool_use: true` to allow at most one tool call in a turn. The `/v1/messages` endpoint dropped this field, so parallel tool calls stayed on. A reviewer noted the missing field when the endpoint was added in #18630, and it was not followed up.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Add the optional `disable_parallel_tool_use` field to `AnthropicToolChoice`.\n- When it is true, the converter sets `parallel_tool_calls=False` on the chat completion request. The chat path already applies that setting to the tool call constraints.\n- New unit test `test_tool_choice_disable_parallel_tool_use_is_forwarded`. Its `disable_parallel_tool_use=True` case fails on main and passes with this change. The whole `test/registered/unit/entrypoints/anthropic` folder passes: 64 passed.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nNot affected. The change only converts the request.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot affected.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #37803243017](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37803243017)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #37803242689](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37803242689)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #37803243248](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37803243248)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
